  <div class="col">
    <div class="card">

      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title"></h5>
        <p class="card-text"><h2> <strong> Who We Are</strong></h2>
 <p> Welcome to Lions Clubs International District 404B2 Nigeria, a community of dedicated individuals committed to making a positive impact in our society. Our members come from diverse backgrounds but share a common goal: to serve others with passion, compassion, and humility.<br>

With clubs located throughout Nigeria, we strive to address the unique needs of our local communities while also collaborating with fellow Lions Clubs around the globe to create sustainable change. From providing access to quality education, healthcare, and economic opportunities to combating climate change and promoting peace and international understanding, we are dedicated to serving those most in need.</p>
.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card" style="width: 50rem">
  <%= image_tag "leader.png" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="card">
     <div class="card" style="width: 50rem">
  <%= image_tag "womenleader.png" %>


      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="card">

      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title"><strong>District Governor</strong></h5>
        <p class="card-text">
Greetings, fellow Lions and cherished friends!
It is with heartfelt joy and a deep sense of responsibility that I welcome you to the 2025–2026 Lions Service Year. Together, we will embark on a journey rooted in compassion, service, and impactful leadership.
This is a year for REAL service. As your District Governor, I encourage you to show an unwavering commitment to serve, as we work together to create meaningful and sustainable change in our communities.
Our district stands firmly on the foundation of service that uplifts, empowers, and transforms. With your passion and dedication, I am confident that we will surpass our goals and leave a lasting legacy of kindness, hope, and unity.
Let us make this a remarkable year by serving with purpose and leading with heart.
Yours in service,
Lion Oluwakemi Eribake MJF NLCF
District Governor 2025/2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

